cutive loan renewals.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"req_id\": \"SD-013\",\n      \"type\": \"incompleteness\",\n      \"subtype\": \"missing_error_handling\",\n      \"evidence\": \"validate item eligibility within 2 seconds and issue the loan receipt\",\n      \"related_ids\": [],\n      \"rationale\": \"Describes only the happy path for item eligibility validation at the self-checkout kiosk without specifying system behavior when an item is ineligible or barcode scanning fails.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"req_id\": \"SD-014\",\n      \"type\": \"incompleteness\",\n      \"subtype\": \"missing_value_or_unit\",\n      \"evidence\": \"the allowed maximum number of active hold requests\",\n      \"related_ids\": [],\n      \"rationale\": \"References a numeric cap ('the allowed maximum number of active hold requests') without specifying the actual number.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"req_id\": \"SD-015\",\n      \"type\": \"inconsistency\",\n      \"subtype\": \"conflicting_values\",\n      \"evidence\": \"borrow up to 8 physical items simultaneously\",\n      \"related_ids\": [\n        \"SD-009\"\n      ],\n      \"rationale\": \"Allows a Member in good standing to borrow up to 8 physical items simultaneously, conflicting with SD-009 which caps simultaneous checkouts at 5 physical items.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"req_id\": \"SD-016\",\n      \"type\": \"inconsistency\",\n      \"subtype\": \"conflicting_values\",\n      \"evidence\": \"21 calendar days from the checkout timestamp\",\n      \"related_ids\": [\n        \"SD-010\"\n      ],\n      \"rationale\": \"Sets the standard loan period for circulating print books to 21 calendar days, conflicting with SD-010 which sets it to 14 calendar days.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"req_id\": \"SD-017\",\n      \"type\": \"inconsistency\",\n      \"subtype\": \"conflicting_rules\",\n      \"evidence\": \"self-register online with only an email address and immediately check out physical books without Librarian ID verification\",\n      \"related_ids\": [\n        \"SD-001\"\n      ],\n      \"rationale\": \"Allows unverified visitors to self-register with only an email and borrow physical books without ID verification, contradicting SD-001 which requires a Librarian to verify government-issued photo ID and record full name, email, and phone before account creation.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"req_id\": \"SD-018\",\n      \"type\": \"inconsistency\",\n      \"subtype\": \"conflicting_rules\",\n      \"evidence\": \"remain held indefinitely until the requesting Member explicitly cancels the hold\",\n      \"related_ids\": [\n        \"SD-011\"\n      ],\n      \"rationale\": \"States that reserved items on the pickup shelf are held indefinitely until cancelled by the Member, contradicting SD-011 which requires cancelling uncollected holds after exactly 72 hours.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"req_id\": \"SD-021\",\n      \"type\": \"ambiguity\",\n      \"subtype\": \"coordination\",\n      \"evidence\": \"send an overdue email and/or suspend borrowing privileges and/or apply a penalty flag\",\n      \"related_ids\": [],\n      \"rationale\": \"Uses chained 'and/or' connectives, leaving it ambiguous which combination of actions is mandatory when an item is 7 days overdue.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"req_id\": \"SD-022\",\n      \"type\": \"incompleteness\",\n      \"subtype\": \"missing_actor\",\n      \"evidence\": \"shall be reviewed, approved, and recorded\",\n      \"related_ids\": [],\n      \"rationale\": \"Uses passive voice without identifying which human role or system component is responsible for reviewing, approving, and recording fine waiver requests.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"req_id\": \"SD-023\",\n      \"type\": \"ambiguity\",\n      \"subtype\": \"weak_phrase\",\n      \"evidence\": \"if appropriate\",\n      \"related_ids\": [],\n      \"rationale\": \"Includes the non-binding qualifier 'if appropriate' (and leaves 'before the due date' unquantified), making alert dispatch subjective and unte